      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "{name} 선수의 연습 경기 성적이 며칠째 바닥이다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "{name}'s scrim results have been rock bottom for days.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "16a08fc8-f0e4-586f-bc28-6d1770c40754",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…뭘 해도 안 돼요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "…Nothing I do works.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4ee776dd-6ca0-5248-9d80-0e48f4e96f15",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "사건 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "0bc460c3-4e9a-573d-9e20-87a6139cb830"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "8afa4ba4-aa39-521b-8ba5-fa8d93b37513": "incident",
        "fbdf9c14-fee4-53f6-9aa0-ce378771498a": -1,
        "145ef026-0b4d-580b-aa4b-c6e716535276": 0,
        "1a700450-fdbf-5827-a655-d5435bd571ca": "",
        "f557de07-0745-5854-b5ba-ef05d87dbc1f": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bed1f89c-73e6-50fc-a1be-4b39ce08d35d",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a61c718c-9383-5e91-9860-5f607bcfad65",
          "text": "며칠 기본기만 하자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "7c9925ed-32e0-5a0f-a797-66dbb9286374": "ok>pmod:field_hit:+2:2;ok>trust:+2;ng>pmod:field_hit:-2:1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cd2caaea-6280-5d24-b468-e86754cceb89",
          "text": "하던 대로 해. 곧 돌아와.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "7c9925ed-32e0-5a0f-a797-66dbb9286374": "ok>trust:+3;ng>pmod:all:-2:1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "a217c1e3-ee40-50f4-a56d-26e7e9ac416c",
          "text": "자리 경쟁 붙일 수도 있어.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "7c9925ed-32e0-5a0f-a797-66dbb9286374": "chk:-20;ok>pmod:all:+2:1;ng>trust:-6;ng>pmod:all:-2:2"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:a61c718c-9383-5e91-9860-5f607bcfad65": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Let's just do fundamentals for a few days.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:cd2caaea-6280-5d24-b468-e86754cceb89": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Keep doing what you do. It'll come back.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:a217c1e3-ee40-50f4-a56d-26e7e9ac416c": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I might open up your spot for competition.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "387f17a6-3e68-5ed8-85a3-2f004d8b3b50",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "기본기부터… 해 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Back to basics… I'll try.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "4099538f-98d9-5bd5-98f8-9aae2089d286": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b46b8403-829c-5b70-a1b9-96950333d9e3",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "그래도 안 되면요?",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "And if that doesn't work either?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "4099538f-98d9-5bd5-98f8-9aae2089d286": "ng"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "db9efd4f-aec8-5a82-88ff-b0c3fe89b496",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 10,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네 믿어 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Okay. I'll trust you.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "4099538f-98d9-5bd5-98f8-9aae2089d286": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "71ffe07e-ce5d-50a7-809b-21523eb0a7c9",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 11,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "…",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "4099538f-98d9-5bd5-98f8-9aae2089d286": "ng"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ed6a6b70-8a0f-5d0f-8f66-feeca3b658f5",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 12,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 300,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…지지 않을 거예요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "…I'm not going to lose.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "4099538f-98d9-5bd5-98f8-9aae2089d286": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f9c3702d-1ce9-592b-8109-19830a07caa9",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 13,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 300,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "그렇게까지 말씀하셔야 해요?",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Did you really have to go that far?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "4099538f-98d9-5bd5-98f8-9aae2089d286": "ng"
      }
    }
